AngelServer
===========

This repository contains SOURCE CODE ONLY.

It provides a local, offline server for a game client that the USER must
already own.  No part of the game -- executable, data, art, audio, text,
master data, resource manifest or save data -- is included here, and none
may be contributed.

If you obtained this project expecting a playable game, you are in the
wrong place: you need your own copy of the client.  See README.md.

